+        orientations. Returns an empty tuple when no route remains feasible.
+
+    Raises
+    ------
+    ValueError
+        If a route kind, constraint, guide, inventory, or result limit is invalid.
+    TypeError
+        If ``policy`` or ``limits`` has an invalid type.
+    PathSearchLimitError
